### What rental income can a legal basement suite generate in Delta BC?

A legal one-bedroom basement suite in Delta (North Delta, Ladner, Tsawwassen) rents for $1,600–$2,200/month in the current market. A two-bedroom suite commands $1,800–$3,500/month depending on neighbourhood and finishes. At $1,800/month, a $90,000 suite investment provides $21,600 in gross annual rental income — a strong return relative to the construction cost. Delta''s rental vacancy is tight due to its proximity to Vancouver, the new Alex Fraser Bridge corridors, and the Nordel/Scott Road Skytrain expansion plans.

