### What renovation provides the best return on investment for a Burnaby home?

For Burnaby homes, kitchen renovation consistently delivers the strongest ROI — particularly in Metrotown-adjacent properties and Brentwood neighbourhoods where buyer expectations are highest. A mid-range kitchen renovation ($26,000–$32,000) in Burnaby returns 150–180% of cost at resale in 2026 market conditions. Bathroom renovation ROI in Burnaby runs 120–160%. For expert [Pre-Sale Renovation Advice](/en/services/realtor/) before listing, speak with our renovation team. Basement legal suite conversions offer the highest absolute value uplift ($150,000–$250,000 appraised value increase) but require the largest upfront investment ($65,000–$100,000).

